		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Smooth, featureless marble statue that houses a gem in its chest. Gem is the soul- cage of its arcane creator.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 18, <strong>HP</strong> 35, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 slam +4 (1d8) or 1 spell +6, <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +0, <strong>D</strong> +0, <strong>C</strong> +4, <strong>I</strong> +3, <strong>W</strong> +0, <strong>Ch</strong> +1, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 7</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Arcane Armor (INT Spell)</strong>. Self. DC 12. AC 16 for 2d4 rounds.</p><p></p><p><strong>Blast (INT Spell)</strong>. DC 12. Far, one target. 2d6 damage.</p><p></p><p><strong>Bolt (INT Spell)</strong>. DC 13. A 5- foot wide line of electricity extending far from the statue. 3d6 damage.</p><p></p><p><strong>Construct</strong>. Only damaged by adamantine or magical sources.</p><p></p><p><strong>Fly (INT Spell)</strong>. DC 12. Self. Fly for 5 rounds, double near movement.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
